# This app's R8 keep rules. It is a `keepRules` source set (AGP 9.3+), so every `.keep` file here is
# picked up with no `proguardFiles` entry naming it. It sits in `main` rather than `release` so the
# opt-in `-PminifyDebug` build the device lane runs minifies against the same rules as release; a
# per-variant copy is the one that goes stale.
#
# Retrofit, OkHttp, Room, Hilt, Coil and kotlinx.serialization ship their own consumer rules. Only
# what this app genuinely needs on top of those belongs here: a rule copied from a library silently
# diverges when the library is upgraded, and the copy is the one that goes stale.

# Line numbers and source file names, so a crash a user reports reads as a stack trace.
-keepattributes SourceFile,LineNumberTable
-renamesourcefileattribute SourceFile

# Every annotation attribute on kept classes. The bundled Retrofit and serialization rules keep only
# RuntimeVisible* and AnnotationDefault; this additionally keeps type-use and CLASS-retention
# annotations, and attributes cost R8 nothing to keep.
-keepattributes *Annotation*

# R8 full mode shrinks a @Serializable class nothing references. A Retrofit method whose parsed
# response is discarded leaves its DTO unreferenced, so the class goes and the method's return type
# collapses to Object: "Serializer for class 'Any' is not found". Only the class need survive; the
# generated serializer references the fields itself, and the bundled rules retain Companion and
# serializer().
-keep,allowobfuscation,allowoptimization @kotlinx.serialization.Serializable class **

# The lite protobuf runtime resolves a message's fields by name the first time it is used
# (MessageSchema reads the names newMessageInfo() recorded), and neither protobuf-javalite nor grpc
# ships a consumer rule. Keeping the fields of every generated message is protobuf's own guidance for
# the lite runtime under R8. The messages are the contract, and small; the classes themselves may
# still go or be renamed, and the device lane is what proves the rest of the transport survives.
-keepclassmembers class * extends com.google.protobuf.GeneratedMessageLite { <fields>; }
